      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Disagree with 2, score 3. The judge's own rationale quotes pli_003: \"purchased land in Schuylkill County in 1875 (Deed Book 42, p. 118 ...)\". judge_context requires the response to state what the source records (a land purchase, a deed) \"however briefly\", and says it \"does not have to be a numbered plan item\", so content in a plan-item rationale satisfies it. Marking down because the survey section repeats only the place and date applies a stricter rule than the test sets.\n"
    },
    {
      "test_id": "ut_research_plan_011",
      "dimension_source": "base",
