      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "Agree 2. Checked the research_append call: three FamilySearch census items (1870/1880/1900), all fallback_for null, no Ancestry item. judge_context requires at least one Ancestry fallback_for chain, so the plan misses a stated requirement. Unrelated to this PR, which does not touch research-plan; 011 passed in v12 and v13 on main, so this is run-to-run variance in whether the agent adds paid fallbacks.\n"
    },
